ister: turned 65 on February 9; wants to stop 401(k) deferrals next period.\n\nQuestions to Rosa, ext. 12, or rdelgado@hargrovetool.example. Shop line 330-555-0170.", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "292 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["R. Delgado", "Earl Hargrove III", "Bill McAllister", "Thanh Nguyen", "DeShawn Jefferson", "Marisola Lopez", "Katarzyna Wisniewski"], "companies": ["HARGROVE TOOL & DIE CO.", "PayRight Processing", "Machinists Lodge 2211", "Cuyahoga Valley Bank", "Hargrove, Inc.", "Apex Bank", "Sheet Metal Union"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.19999999925494194, "modelMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 23, "text": "HARGROVE TOOL & DIE CO.", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "HARGROVE TOOL & DIE CO."}, {"start": 54, "end": 56, "text": "PP", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "PayRight Processing"}, {"start": 61, "end": 71, "text": "02/01/2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "02/01/2026"}, {"start": 74, "end": 84, "text": "02/14/2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "02/14/2026"}, {"start": 104, "end": 114, "text": "02/20/2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "02/20/2026"}, {"start": 128, "end": 138, "text": "R. Delgado", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "R. Delgado"}, {"start": 168, "end": 187, "text": "PayRight Processing", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "PayRight Processing"}, {"start": 199, "end": 207, "text": "HTD-0932", "kind": "passport_dl", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "HTD-0932"}, {"start": 325, "end": 329, "text": "1004", "kind": "account", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "1004"}, {"start": 333, 